<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Progenics Pharmaceuticals Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Progenics Pharmaceuticals Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Progenics Pharmaceuticals Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			PRGN.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $11-$13/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    8,554,553</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  300,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Biopharmaceutical company focusing on development and commercialization of innovative products for treatment and prevention of cancer and viral diseases.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: to fund clinical trials of its product candidates, research and development, in-licensing of late stage technology and for working capital purposes and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s - year ended Dec 31:</p>
<p>				    1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		    $821		 $664</p>
<p>   - Net Income (loss)   ($4,504)	   ($3,412)</p>
